    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfac Welcome to Clip Maker \u2013 The Ultimate Creative Playground \ud83c\udfad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wanted to make a 4K 360\u00b0 time-traveling anime music video with sword-wielding robots, crying vampires, and a catgirl DJ... all dancing under fireworks in slow motion?<br>Well now you can.<br><strong>Clip Maker</strong> doesn\u2019t ask why \u2014 it asks <i>how many frames per second?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f What is Clip Maker?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think of it like Photoshop, After Effects, a movie studio, and a cosplay convention had a wild party in a VR headset.<br>Create <i>anything</i> your bizarre, brilliant brain can imagine:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4K and 8K video clips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VR movies (yes, stereoscopic ones!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual novels, comics, manga</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wallpapers your desktop will worship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or just scenes where your characters act out your wildest fanfics. (<i>No judgment here.</i>)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Comes Packed With Goodies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like a loot box with no regrets:<br>\u2714 13 characters<br>\u2714 1385 animations (that\u2019s a lot of dancing)<br>\u2714 92 dramatic poses<br>\u2714 13 pre-built scenes<br>\u2714 166 prefab scene builder pieces<br>\u2714 82 weapons (because drama needs swords)<br>\u2714 598 VFX (because swords need sparks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if that\u2019s not enough?<br>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>FREE DLC</strong> includes:<br>\u2714 4550 more prefabs<br>\u2714 5386 more animations<br>(That\u2019s right, we give you more stuff for $0. Take that, capitalism.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Integrations &amp; Importing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your own content like a digital god:<br>VRoid, MMD, DAZ3D, FBX, Poser, even images, videos, and audio clips \u2014 toss them in and make magic.<br>Turn your PC into Hollywood... or an anime fever dream. Either works.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to Use, Hard to Stop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything's managed with a simple interface.<br>Dozens of video tutorials (with subtitles in your language!) walk you through it like a chill best friend who actually knows what they\u2019re doing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Timeline System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s like a time machine \u2014 but sexier.<br>\u2714 Full camera control<br>\u2714 Slow-mo, speed-up, bounce &amp; arc modes<br>\u2714 Lights, VFX, audio, billboards<br>\u2714 HDRI skies &amp; scene builder<br>\u2714 Save/load your timelines (so you can finish that \u201cepic catfight in space\u201d later)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\uddcd Character Customization That Goes Way Too Far</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Animation &amp; pose changer<br>\u2714 Eyes, hair, makeup, wardrobe, emotions<br>\u2714 &quot;Look at this&quot; system (finally!)<br>\u2714 Talk system (characters can TALK)<br>\u2714 Color everything. Go neon. Regret nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Tools, Tools, Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Green screen &amp; chroma key<br>\u2714 Video/audio converters<br>\u2714 Stream to YouTube, Twitch &amp; Facebook<br>\u2714 Voice recorder, webcam integration<br>\u2714 YouTube downloader (<i>you didn\u2019t hear that from us</i>)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udce4 Export to Almost Anything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 MP4, H264, Hevc, ProRes, VP8, VP9<br>\u2714 Transparent PNGs<br>\u2714 GIFs (because GIFs make everything better)<br>\u2714 Green screen videos for your next meme masterpiece</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 YOU OWN EVERYTHING YOU CREATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously. It\u2019s yours. No weird licensing.<br>Post it to YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, or your cousin\u2019s suspicious new platform.<br>We won\u2019t stop you. In fact \u2014 we\u2019ll cheer you on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clip Maker</strong> \u2014 it\u2019s not just a tool.<br>It\u2019s your weird little creative empire.<br><i>Go make something ridiculous.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfac Welcome to Clip Maker \u2013 The Ultimate Creative Playground \ud83c\udfad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wanted to make a 4K 360\u00b0 time-traveling anime music video with sword-wielding robots, crying vampires, and a catgirl DJ... all dancing under fireworks in slow motion?<br>Well now you can.<br><strong>Clip Maker</strong> doesn\u2019t ask why \u2014 it asks <i>how many frames per second?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f What is Clip Maker?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think of it like Photoshop, After Effects, a movie studio, and a cosplay convention had a wild party in a VR headset.<br>Create <i>anything</i> your bizarre, brilliant brain can imagine:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4K and 8K video clips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VR movies (yes, stereoscopic ones!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual novels, comics, manga</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wallpapers your desktop will worship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or just scenes where your characters act out your wildest fanfics. (<i>No judgment here.</i>)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Comes Packed With Goodies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like a loot box with no regrets:<br>\u2714 13 characters<br>\u2714 1385 animations (that\u2019s a lot of dancing)<br>\u2714 92 dramatic poses<br>\u2714 13 pre-built scenes<br>\u2714 166 prefab scene builder pieces<br>\u2714 82 weapons (because drama needs swords)<br>\u2714 598 VFX (because swords need sparks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if that\u2019s not enough?<br>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>FREE DLC</strong> includes:<br>\u2714 4550 more prefabs<br>\u2714 5386 more animations<br>(That\u2019s right, we give you more stuff for $0. Take that, capitalism.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Integrations &amp; Importing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your own content like a digital god:<br>VRoid, MMD, DAZ3D, FBX, Poser, even images, videos, and audio clips \u2014 toss them in and make magic.<br>Turn your PC into Hollywood... or an anime fever dream. Either works.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to Use, Hard to Stop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything's managed with a simple interface.<br>Dozens of video tutorials (with subtitles in your language!) walk you through it like a chill best friend who actually knows what they\u2019re doing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Timeline System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s like a time machine \u2014 but sexier.<br>\u2714 Full camera control<br>\u2714 Slow-mo, speed-up, bounce &amp; arc modes<br>\u2714 Lights, VFX, audio, billboards<br>\u2714 HDRI skies &amp; scene builder<br>\u2714 Save/load your timelines (so you can finish that \u201cepic catfight in space\u201d later)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\uddcd Character Customization That Goes Way Too Far</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Animation &amp; pose changer<br>\u2714 Eyes, hair, makeup, wardrobe, emotions<br>\u2714 &quot;Look at this&quot; system (finally!)<br>\u2714 Talk system (characters can TALK)<br>\u2714 Color everything. Go neon. Regret nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Tools, Tools, Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Green screen &amp; chroma key<br>\u2714 Video/audio converters<br>\u2714 Stream to YouTube, Twitch &amp; Facebook<br>\u2714 Voice recorder, webcam integration<br>\u2714 YouTube downloader (<i>you didn\u2019t hear that from us</i>)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udce4 Export to Almost Anything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 MP4, H264, Hevc, ProRes, VP8, VP9<br>\u2714 Transparent PNGs<br>\u2714 GIFs (because GIFs make everything better)<br>\u2714 Green screen videos for your next meme masterpiece</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 YOU OWN EVERYTHING YOU CREATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously. It\u2019s yours. No weird licensing.<br>Post it to YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, or your cousin\u2019s suspicious new platform.<br>We won\u2019t stop you. In fact \u2014 we\u2019ll cheer you on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clip Maker</strong> \u2014 it\u2019s not just a tool.<br>It\u2019s your weird little creative empire.<br><i>Go make something ridiculous.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Create epic videos, animations, visual novels, comics, and more\u2014no pro skills needed! Clip Maker lets you build wild scenes, control characters, and bring your stories to life in 4K, 8K, VR, or even GIFs. Unleash your inner director today for FREE!",
